# 5.3 after a replug the restored Monado cannot acquire the display: the gate says needs-reboot, no more retries.
start desk
at 10 down usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
at 120 up usb.hid usb.cam usb.eye display.dp1
expect 125 ran start monado
at 140 monado-log ERROR [comp_window_direct] vkAcquireDrmDisplayEXT failed: VK_ERROR_INITIALIZATION_FAILED
at 141 exit monado code=1
at 141 down wayvr passthrough ctrltrack perf broker
expect 142 gate needs-reboot
expect 142 overall needs-reboot
expect 142 notified Reboot needed
expect 400 runs 2
